gNB: several cells, each with its own radio address (extraCells).

UERANSIM v3.3.0's gNB has one cell: one NR Cell Identity (nci), one radio
address (linkIp), reported for every UE. extraCells lists more cells, each
{ nci, linkIp }: the gNB listens on every address, answers each with that
cell's transmitter identity (the UE tells cells apart by it), and reports
to the AMF the cell a UE is attached through (User Location Information).
A UE should search one cell of a gNB only (gnbSearchList). Used by
LibreCN's demo.sh (its first gNB has two cells).

